  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe UI link listener now enforces a 5-second deadline and 4 KiB buffer cap on incoming connections before token validation:\n1. `crates/app/src/mcp/listen.rs`: added `HELLO_TIMEOUT` (5 seconds) and `MAX_HELLO_LINE` (4 KiB) for pre-hello connections. Connections that do not send a matching hello line within 5 seconds or send more than 4 KiB without a newline are closed with `HELLO_REFUSED`.\n2. Once authenticated, normal session limits (`IDLE_TIMEOUT` of 5 minutes, `MAX_LINE` of 16 MiB) apply.\n3. Added `Inbox::link_with_timeouts` so tests can test timeout behavior deterministically.\n\n## Decisions\n\nRecorded in `docs/decisions/3873-pre-hello-limits.md`.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `camcraft_app::tests::mcp_live::ui_link::an_unauthenticated_client_holding_the_link_times_out_and_releases_it`\n- `camcraft_app::tests::mcp_live::ui_link::the_link_folder_is_the_users_own`\n- `camcraft_app::tests::mcp_live::ui_link::the_link_file_follows_the_open_project`\n- `camcraft_app::tests::mcp_live::ui_link::a_wrong_token_is_refused_and_the_window_goes_on_serving`\n- `camcraft_app::tests::mcp_live::ui_link::bad_ui_arguments_are_usage_errors`\n- `camcraft_app::tests::mcp_live::ui_link::a_cli_call_with_no_window_says_so_and_exits_3`\n\nChangelog: UI link: drop unauthenticated clients after 5 seconds or 4 KiB before token validation\nFixes #3873\n\n## Merge refresh verification\n\nLocal head: `2aa36849081210e4929dd04d09391c4076bb8bfd`.\nBase: `upstream/main` at `582981bfa`.\nThe worktree is clean. The merge is not pushed.\n\nCommand: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`.\nResult: RED / stopped on a hanging test. The gate planned 3 steps.\n\n- Step 1, app build: PASS, 48 seconds.\n- Step 2, app lib: PASS, 307 tests, 0 failures, 36 seconds.\n- Step 3, app mcp_live: INCOMPLETE. The busy-window test did not finish.\n\nThe pre-hello timeout pin passed:\n`ui_link::an_unauthenticated_client_holding_the_link_times_out_and_releases_it`.\nThe other original UI link pins also passed.\n\nThe retained main test hung:\n`ui_link::a_second_ui_call_during_a_slow_call_reports_busy_and_exits_4`.\nThe log reports: `has been running for over 60 seconds`.\n\nInteraction:\n- `crates/app/tests/mcp_live/ui_link.rs:242-250`: client 1 connects but sends no hello.\n- `crates/app/tests/mcp_live/ui_link.rs:258-259`: client 2 calls the CLI synchronously, before the test serves requests.\n- The PR closes client 1 after its new 5-second pre-hello limit.\n- Client 2 can then authenticate. `crates/app/src/mcp/link_client.rs:140` clears its read timeout.\n- Client 2 waits for a tool reply. The test does not serve its request, so it cannot reach the expected busy error.\n\nThe gate was interrupted with Ctrl-C. Its session exited with code 130. No further checks ran.\nNo production logic or test logic changed during verification.\nNo verification artifact was committed.\n\nNot exercised: clippy and example_catalog, because the required quick gate did not complete.\nGoldens moved: not assessed; example_catalog was not run. No recorded program changed in this refresh.\nHeavy lanes: not run; this refresh touches MCP, not app operations.\nMutation proof: not run; this is a merge refresh with no new logic fix.\nScreenshots: not applicable; no UI appearance changed.\n",
